<title>USA: Hussey copper price unchanged at $1.09.</title>
<headline>Hussey copper price unchanged at $1.09.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hussey Copper Ltd said its contained copper price was unchanged at 109 cents a lb Friday, the price that has been effective from October 10 shipments.</p>
<p>--New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
